# Zebar widgets are committed as prebuilt SvelteKit output — there is no source
# in this repo to rebuild them from, so the bundles have to be tracked. Their
# filenames are content hashes, so every upstream rebuild deletes and re-adds
# the whole tree; collapse that noise instead of trying to diff it.
#
# -text also opts them out of core.autocrlf: these are build artifacts, nothing
# hand-edits them on Windows, and letting git rewrite their line endings only
# invents diffs against a bundle that never changed.
dot_glzr/zebar/**/_app/**   linguist-generated -diff -text
dot_glzr/zebar/**/index.html linguist-generated -text
